{"id":2280,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为庆祝三八国际劳动妇女节，丰富女教职工文化生活，我院3月9日在学院楼A座115会议室举办“指尖微森林、邂逅小时光”多肉种植DIY主题活动，让大家在动手创作中感受自然之美，共度温馨节日。</p><p>活动现场绿意盎然，准备了多样多肉植株、花盆及园艺工具。老师现场讲解多肉养护知识与种植技巧，示范盆栽制作流程。大家认真学习，精心挑选多肉，填土、造型、装饰，亲手打造专属微景观。现场气氛轻松愉悦，欢声笑语不断，彼此交流分享，尽享手作乐趣。</p><p>此次活动不仅让大家放松身心、舒缓压力，更传递了学校对女教职工的关怀与祝福，提升了幸福感与归属感。大家在方寸绿意中邂逅美好时光，展现了新时代女性热爱生活、积极向上的良好风貌。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ToRlt4Ml-sLmQ2ojRr7MzCPLRNiMRfw7nNrVLNWko7VRU490gihFp2hmCIa0nSh7LYhknkhRoz6fM4G4nmrknmrVL4v4ozUYLzlZLzv8n7WFU4-bnlQfUmfFMz9PM49Jqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLRLiM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10356&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/ED3BDC97A703F5BF5E373942158174DB/C29EFAB0/58178\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 463px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TozAtRUmCiLRWRnjlL4U4-4LRvbU4lwPM8M7L7C4L7r7nzv0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhRnSyaMSyPo7lsMmGbU46kLm9ZMlL4L4TfM4Cinz6RUmnFnmlbnm9ZnRMFMz78M77igtXaQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0LzG4MzCJqdXnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10356&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TL4GtbnRLZMRM7MjNUDozrVLzCsLlCwsUz9iMmUYMz74LlU0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyaLYh2nSybo7WfMRGaMzlPLzn2ozGPnRLsMm-DUNCDUNQFM8nRnRAkUNrFMm-DMzvJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLRLiM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10356&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/103FE98BA40055114F901D37626BF6BF/7DCD8BBE/62657\" vheight=\" 347.259px\" vwidth=\" 463px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TUl-t4nmMRoRGsojzlsoln2oRUinR7waLRUbUm6RUlUinRC0gihFp2hmCIa0oSy8U1yYM1ybnz74oRvZn77YozNDLmLYLl7aUlU4ozARnmnFMRV2L4QkMz6FM7CZLRCigtXaQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0LzG4MzCJqdXnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10356&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TU4Wtknml8nz-YnjNUZLmN4LlWkMRvwYnmlZLN-8U4vsMRG0gihFp2hmCIa0MSybUSy8okhRn7liLm6RLRCiL4C4MmfRnNLaLm9bL4U8UzfFM7MfozGYoRAFUzMfozCJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLRLiM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10356&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/59A48CDE527C06536360CFC0289344A0/4CA90288/A3A96\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 